User: Given that $\overline{MN}\parallel\overline{AB}$, how many units long is $\overline{BN}$?

[asy] pair A,B,M,N,C;
M = 1.2*dir(255); N = dir(285);
A = 3*M; B = 3*N;
draw(M--N--C--A--B--N);
label("A",A,W);label("M",M,W);
label("3",C--M,W);label("5",M--A,W);
label("2.4",C--N,E);label("N",N,E);label("B",B,E);
[/asy]
